WEBVTT

00:00:03.406 --> 00:00:04.407
♪ Hey♪

00:00:06.322 --> 00:00:09.325
♪ Woke up
in the morning light ♪

00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:13.894
♪ Today is the day
that I do everything right ♪

00:00:13.938 --> 00:00:17.376
♪ Now that I'm queen,
I've got a kingdom to run ♪

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.901
♪ 'Cause Trolls,
they wanna have fun ♪

00:00:20.945 --> 00:00:24.078
♪ Yeah, Trolls just
wanna have fun ♪

00:00:24.122 --> 00:00:26.124
-♪ They just wanna
-♪ Hey♪

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.778
♪ They just wanna

00:00:27.821 --> 00:00:29.997
-♪ They just wanna
-♪ Hey♪

00:00:30.041 --> 00:00:31.782
♪ Trolls just wanna have fun

00:00:31.825 --> 00:00:34.654
♪ Lived underground
to get away from the world ♪

00:00:34.698 --> 00:00:39.877
♪ Till I had my life changed
by a beautiful girl ♪

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.097
♪ Just need the guts to
tell her that she's the one ♪

00:00:43.141 --> 00:00:47.101
♪ But you know, Trolls,
they wanna have fun ♪

00:00:47.145 --> 00:00:50.017
♪ Oh, Trolls just wanna have

00:00:50.061 --> 00:00:54.108
♪ That's all they really want

00:00:54.152 --> 00:00:57.155
♪ Some fun

00:00:57.198 --> 00:01:01.115
♪ When the working day
is done ♪

00:01:01.159 --> 00:01:05.119
♪ Oh, Trolls,
they wanna have fun ♪

00:01:05.163 --> 00:01:07.600
♪ Oh, Trolls just wanna have.

00:01:07.644 --> 00:01:09.733
[whoops, laughs]

00:01:09.776 --> 00:01:10.951
All right, Queen Poppy.

00:01:10.995 --> 00:01:12.475
I've prepared an agenda
for the day.

00:01:12.518 --> 00:01:15.695
Oh. Well, I hope it says
singing, dancing and hugging.

00:01:15.739 --> 00:01:16.957
Ow-ow!

00:01:17.001 --> 00:01:19.090
Uh, isn't that
what we do every day?

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:21.005
Yeah! Good times!

00:01:21.048 --> 00:01:22.136
-♪ Good times
-["Good Times" playing]

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:23.442
♪ We have a good time, yeah

00:01:23.486 --> 00:01:25.749
-♪ These are the good times
-[whoops]

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:27.533
-♪ We have a good time, yeah
-♪ Yeah

00:01:27.577 --> 00:01:30.449
-♪ Leave your cares behind
-[whoops]

00:01:30.493 --> 00:01:31.798
-All right!
-Check it out.

00:01:31.842 --> 00:01:34.148
-♪ These are the good times
-[whoops] -Yeah!

00:01:34.192 --> 00:01:35.933
♪ Having the best time,
oh, yeah ♪

00:01:35.976 --> 00:01:38.239
♪ Leave your cares behind

00:01:38.283 --> 00:01:39.545
[auto-tuned scream]

00:01:39.589 --> 00:01:40.764
Poppy, come quick!

00:01:40.807 --> 00:01:42.026
It's an emergency!

00:01:42.069 --> 00:01:43.941
Guy Diamond, what's wrong?

00:01:43.984 --> 00:01:46.073
I'm having a baby!

00:01:46.117 --> 00:01:47.205
[all scream]

00:01:47.248 --> 00:01:49.120
BOTH:
We're on jumpsuit duty.

00:01:49.163 --> 00:01:50.600
I get to be a role model.

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:52.558
I don't want to be
a big sister.

00:01:52.602 --> 00:01:55.300
-[bell dings]
-[gasps, sighs]

00:01:55.343 --> 00:01:57.781
CHORUS:
♪ Oh, sparkly baby.

00:01:57.824 --> 00:01:58.999
ALL:
Aw.

00:01:59.043 --> 00:02:00.653
What should I name him?

00:02:00.697 --> 00:02:01.654
Hmm.

00:02:01.698 --> 00:02:04.178
How about... Tiny Diamond?

00:02:04.222 --> 00:02:05.484
-♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah
-[rap beat playing]

00:02:05.528 --> 00:02:07.399
♪ Tiny Diamond is my name

00:02:07.443 --> 00:02:09.488
♪ Come straight from
my daddy's mane ♪

00:02:09.532 --> 00:02:11.490
-♪ My whole body's
made of glitter ♪ - Yeah♪

00:02:11.534 --> 00:02:13.492
-♪ And I'll throw it
in your face ♪ - Face♪

00:02:13.536 --> 00:02:15.189
-♪ I love when I make music
-♪ Oh, yeah♪

00:02:15.233 --> 00:02:17.670
-♪ And the groove is
in my bones ♪ - My bones♪

00:02:17.714 --> 00:02:19.455
♪ Just like
my Aunt Queen Poppy ♪

00:02:19.498 --> 00:02:22.109
-♪ Someday I'll sit
on the throne ♪ - Get Tiny.♪

00:02:22.153 --> 00:02:24.024
♪ Groove is in the heart

00:02:24.068 --> 00:02:25.852
♪ Ah-ah-ah-ah

00:02:25.896 --> 00:02:28.115
♪ Groove is in the heart

00:02:28.159 --> 00:02:30.117
-♪ Ah-ah-ah-ah
-♪ Yeah

00:02:30.161 --> 00:02:32.729
-♪ Yeah
-♪ Yeah, hey

00:02:32.772 --> 00:02:34.470
♪ They just wanna

00:02:34.513 --> 00:02:37.037
-♪ They just wanna
-♪ These are the good times♪

00:02:37.081 --> 00:02:38.778
♪ They just wanna

00:02:38.822 --> 00:02:41.085
-♪ They just wanna
-♪ These are the good times♪

00:02:41.128 --> 00:02:42.826
♪ They just wanna

00:02:42.869 --> 00:02:44.871
-♪ They just wanna
-♪ These are the good times♪

00:02:44.915 --> 00:02:48.919
♪ They just wanna,
they just wanna ♪

00:02:48.962 --> 00:02:51.530
♪ Trolls just wanna have

00:02:51.574 --> 00:02:54.315
♪ Fun.

00:02:54.359 --> 00:02:55.621
[Trolls murmuring happily]

00:02:55.665 --> 00:02:57.884
Hey! That was some
fancy footwork, Cooper.

00:02:57.928 --> 00:02:59.277
Some people just got it.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.236
Biggie, Mr. Dinkles,
you two were on fire!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.021
Yeah, sorry about that,
Queen Poppy.

00:03:04.064 --> 00:03:05.718
[squeaks]

00:03:05.762 --> 00:03:08.068
I'm digging
that new anklet, Legsly.

00:03:08.112 --> 00:03:09.505
Thanks, Poppy.

00:03:09.548 --> 00:03:13.030
Kisses and donuts
and sprinkles!

00:03:13.073 --> 00:03:14.640
Ah, what a Troll.

00:03:14.684 --> 00:03:18.296
Tiny Diamond, welcome
to the family, little buddy.

00:03:18.339 --> 00:03:19.645
Thanks, Aunt Poppy.

00:03:19.689 --> 00:03:21.473
And thanks to this
silver-haired daddy of mine

00:03:21.517 --> 00:03:23.083
for bringing me
into this world.

00:03:23.127 --> 00:03:24.694
Oh.

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.870
I never knew my heart
could be so full.

00:03:26.913 --> 00:03:28.436
Peace and love.
Bless up.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.134
Tiny and Daddy out.

00:03:30.177 --> 00:03:32.528
Oh. Okay, bye.

00:03:33.703 --> 00:03:35.356
Hey, uh, Poppy,

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.750
there's something
I was hoping to ask you.

00:03:37.794 --> 00:03:39.447
I-I mean,
I guess it's something

00:03:39.491 --> 00:03:42.363
I want to tell you, more so.

00:03:42.407 --> 00:03:43.669
-Uh-huh.
-Uh, but listen.

00:03:43.713 --> 00:03:47.064
You could feel free
to respond to it,

00:03:47.107 --> 00:03:49.806
uh, with an answer,
i-if you wanted.

00:03:49.849 --> 00:03:51.068
Sure. What's up?

00:03:51.111 --> 00:03:54.898
Uh, what's up is I, uh,

00:03:54.941 --> 00:03:57.378
I-I-I-I-I-I...

00:03:57.422 --> 00:03:59.772
I wanted to tell you that...

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:02.558
Uh...

00:04:02.601 --> 00:04:03.907
[groans]

00:04:05.343 --> 00:04:07.911
You're crushing it
at this queen thing.

00:04:07.954 --> 00:04:09.782
Aw, Branch, thank you.

00:04:09.826 --> 00:04:11.044
Being a good queen is

00:04:11.088 --> 00:04:13.481
the most important thing
in the world to me.

00:04:13.525 --> 00:04:14.961
Other than being your friend.

00:04:15.005 --> 00:04:17.355
[echoing]:
Friend, friend, friend, friend,

00:04:17.398 --> 00:04:19.618
friend, friend, friend.

00:04:19.662 --> 00:04:21.664
Uh, five it up?

00:04:21.707 --> 00:04:24.318
Huh. That could've been better.
Let's try that again.

00:04:25.058 --> 00:04:27.104
O-Okay, one more.

00:04:27.147 --> 00:04:29.628
Huh. For some reason, we can't
seem to make a good connection.

00:04:29.672 --> 00:04:31.935
-[Poppy chuckles, Branch sighs]
-[Fuzzbert babbling]

00:04:31.978 --> 00:04:33.414
Oh, yes, Fuzzbert!

00:04:33.458 --> 00:04:35.591
-Now, that's a good connection.
-[groans]

00:04:35.634 --> 00:04:37.157
BIGGIE:
[screams] Poppy, help!

00:04:37.201 --> 00:04:38.289
-Ooh.
-Poppy!

00:04:38.332 --> 00:04:40.465
-[shrieking, gasping]
-[wild grunting]

00:04:41.945 --> 00:04:42.989
Watch it, watch it!

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:44.730
-Biggie?
-TROLL: Oh, run!

00:04:44.774 --> 00:04:46.732
-[Trolls clamoring]
-[Biggie screams]

00:04:46.776 --> 00:04:47.994
Help!

00:04:48.038 --> 00:04:50.170
I'm being harangued
by a monster! [gasps]

00:04:50.214 --> 00:04:52.956
-Someone stop it! [shrieks]
-[wild grunting continues]

00:04:54.697 --> 00:04:56.960
Gotcha! Ah! It's in my hair!
It's in my hair!

00:04:57.003 --> 00:04:59.049
-Get it out, get it out,
get it out! -[Branch yells]

00:04:59.092 --> 00:05:01.181
[shushing]

00:05:01.225 --> 00:05:02.356
There you go.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.011
-[eyes boinging]
-[purring]

00:05:05.055 --> 00:05:06.447
There you go. Calm down.

00:05:06.491 --> 00:05:07.971
Who's a good boy?

00:05:08.014 --> 00:05:09.233
What is that thing?

00:05:09.276 --> 00:05:10.364
It's creepy.

00:05:10.408 --> 00:05:11.539
BOTH:
It's scary.

00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:13.890
[auto-tuned]:
And nasty.

00:05:13.933 --> 00:05:16.240
-Hold me, Daddy.
-Oh.

00:05:20.374 --> 00:05:22.768
"To Queen Poppy."

00:05:22.812 --> 00:05:24.117
[Trolls gasp]

00:05:24.161 --> 00:05:25.684
Oh, don't worry, everyone.

00:05:25.728 --> 00:05:27.555
It looks like
it's just an invitation.

00:05:27.599 --> 00:05:28.992
-Whew!
-[relieved murmuring, sighing]

00:05:29.035 --> 00:05:30.341
Just an invitation.

00:05:30.384 --> 00:05:31.908
-COOPER: I love invitations.
-[clears throat]

00:05:31.951 --> 00:05:33.692
"Barb, the Queen of Rock,

00:05:33.736 --> 00:05:37.827
"announces her One Nation
Under Rock World Tour.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.480
"Bring your string
to the biggest party

00:05:39.524 --> 00:05:40.786
the world has ever seen."

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:42.919
-Queen of Rock?
-KING PEPPY: It's nothing!

00:05:42.962 --> 00:05:45.704
It means nothing at all.
It's just junk mail.

00:05:45.748 --> 00:05:46.879
You don't need
to worry about it.

00:05:46.923 --> 00:05:48.185
I mean, quit looking at it,
everyone.

00:05:48.228 --> 00:05:49.839
Forget what you saw!

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:51.101
[chewing noisily]

00:05:51.144 --> 00:05:52.189
[Branch yells]

00:05:52.232 --> 00:05:54.060
-[grunting]
-[shushing]

00:05:54.104 --> 00:05:55.714
-There you go. There you go.
-[eyes boinging]

00:05:55.758 --> 00:05:58.108
-Calm down. Calm down.
-[purring]

00:05:58.151 --> 00:05:59.849
[quietly]:
There you go.

00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:03.113
Okay, I'm calm.

00:06:03.156 --> 00:06:04.114
I'm calm.

00:06:04.157 --> 00:06:06.333
Dad, what's going on?

00:06:06.377 --> 00:06:09.641
Well, I have long feared
this day would come.

00:06:09.685 --> 00:06:12.775
I was hoping to protect you
from this, Poppy.

00:06:12.818 --> 00:06:13.863
Protect me?

00:06:13.906 --> 00:06:15.255
I'm not a little kid
anymore, Dad.

00:06:15.299 --> 00:06:16.648
I'm the queen now.

00:06:17.475 --> 00:06:19.782
You're right.

00:06:19.825 --> 00:06:24.787
The truth is we are not alone
in this world.

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:27.485
[eerie warbling]

00:06:27.528 --> 00:06:29.226
-[warbling stops]
-[stammers, shushes]

00:06:29.269 --> 00:06:31.750
There are other kinds
of Trolls.

00:06:31.794 --> 00:06:33.578
-TROLL: What?
-Wow. That's...

00:06:33.621 --> 00:06:34.666
Dad, that's great.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:36.537
The more Trolls, the merrier.

00:06:36.581 --> 00:06:38.191
You don't understand.

00:06:38.235 --> 00:06:40.237
These other Trolls
aren't like us.

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:42.239
They're different.

00:06:42.282 --> 00:06:43.936
Different how?

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.068
Different like Legsly?

00:06:45.111 --> 00:06:46.460
I love being me.

00:06:46.504 --> 00:06:47.940
-Or Fuzzbert? Or Smidge?
-[Fuzzbert babbling]

00:06:47.984 --> 00:06:49.028
Or Skyscraper Troll?

00:06:49.072 --> 00:06:51.117
[in unison]:
Yeah, different like me?

00:06:51.161 --> 00:06:52.728
No, it's not that.

00:06:52.771 --> 00:06:55.774
They're different in ways
you can't even imagine.

00:06:55.818 --> 00:06:57.950
-[vocalizing pop music]
-You see, we love music

00:06:57.994 --> 00:07:00.387
with a hummable hook,
with an upbeat melody,

00:07:00.431 --> 00:07:03.347
with a catchy rhythm that makes
you want to snap your fingers,

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:05.828
tap your toes
and wiggle your butt.

00:07:05.871 --> 00:07:06.872
That's our music.

00:07:06.916 --> 00:07:09.701
That's what makes us
Pop Trolls.

00:07:09.745 --> 00:07:11.398
-Ooh.
-It is. -Yes.

00:07:11.442 --> 00:07:13.792
But these other Trolls,
they sing different.

00:07:13.836 --> 00:07:15.098
-[gasping]
-They dance different.

00:07:15.141 --> 00:07:17.578
Why, some of them
can't even begin to grasp

00:07:17.622 --> 00:07:20.190
the concept of Hammer Time.

00:07:20.233 --> 00:07:22.540
["U Can't Touch This" playing]

00:07:22.583 --> 00:07:24.107
You can't touch that!

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:25.151
[screaming]

00:07:25.195 --> 00:07:27.371
[Trolls clamoring]

00:07:27.414 --> 00:07:29.460
-[crying]
-[crying]

00:07:29.503 --> 00:07:30.722
[screaming]

00:07:30.766 --> 00:07:32.680
-♪ Stop.
-[music and clamoring stop]

00:07:33.812 --> 00:07:37.076
How about we break down
to a smaller group?

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:39.122
[birds chirping]

00:07:41.167 --> 00:07:44.475
It's a story as old as time.

00:07:44.518 --> 00:07:45.737
[clears throat]

00:07:45.781 --> 00:07:48.696
In the beginning,
there was silence.

